    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then the number of elements in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo largeop=\"true\">&#8745;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is _____.",
