  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;must be equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;In this case&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; will become identity matrix and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;can take any value from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Total number of common element will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math>.</p>",
